{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "inbox-list",
  "title": "Inbox list",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 22.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Rows of messages or conversations: who, when, a subject and a preview, with unread, current and flagged states. The row is the button that opens the message; the newest sit on top.",
    "id": "Baris pesan atau percakapan: siapa, kapan, subjek, dan cuplikan, dengan state belum dibaca, sedang dibuka, dan ditandai. Barisnya adalah tombol yang membuka pesan; yang terbaru ada di atas."
  },
  "titleId": "Inbox list",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "An inbox",
        "desc": "Unread rows carry a dot and full weight; the open message sits on the accent tint. Focus a row and use the Up and Down arrows (or j and k) to move.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox inbox--avatars card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 460px;\" aria-label=\"Inbox\">\n  <button class=\"inbox__row is-unread\" type=\"button\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NP</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Nadia Putri</span><span class=\"ic inbox__flag\" aria-label=\"Flagged\">flag</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">09:12</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Q4 budget: two lines need your sign-off</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">I moved the design tools into opex as we agreed. The travel line is still 8% over, can you look before Friday?</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">GR</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Galih Ramadhan</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-label=\"Has attachments\">attach_file</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">08:40</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Payment page is ready for review</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">Virtual account and card both work in staging. Receipts go out by email within a minute.</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\">\n    <span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SH</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Sari Handayani</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">Yesterday</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Invoice reminders schedule</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">Three days before and on the due date, as discussed. I left the copy in the doc.</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Conversations",
        "desc": "A chat list: name and time on the first line, the last message and an unread count on the second. The current conversation is on the tint.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox inbox--avatars card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 380px;\" aria-label=\"Conversations\">\n  <button class=\"inbox__row is-unread\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LT</span><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Launch team</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">10:02</time></span><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Bima: the release notes are in the doc</span><span class=\"count\">3<span class=\"sr-only\"> unread</span></span></span></span></button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\"><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DL</span><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Dewi Lestari</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">09:47</time></span><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Sounds good, see you at 14:00</span></span></span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "With swipe actions",
        "desc": "On phones each row sits in a swipe: swipe left for archive and delete. Keep the same actions in the reading pane for people who do not swipe.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 420px;\" aria-label=\"Inbox\">\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">archive</span>Archive</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div>\n    <button class=\"inbox__row swipe__row is-unread\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Arif Santoso</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">07:55</time></span><span class=\"inbox__subject\">Bulk invites are live</span><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Paste up to 50 emails, pick a role, send.</span></span></button></div>\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">archive</span>Archive</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete</button></div>\n    <button class=\"inbox__row swipe__row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Dewi Lestari</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">Mon</time></span><span class=\"inbox__subject\">Dark mode for charts</span><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Series colors pass in both themes now.</span></span></button></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Kotak masuk",
        "desc": "Baris belum dibaca punya titik dan huruf tebal; pesan yang terbuka berada di tint aksen. Fokuskan satu baris dan pakai panah Atas dan Bawah (atau j dan k) untuk berpindah.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox inbox--avatars card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 460px;\" aria-label=\"Kotak masuk\">\n  <button class=\"inbox__row is-unread\" type=\"button\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NP</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Nadia Putri</span><span class=\"ic inbox__flag\" aria-label=\"Ditandai\">flag</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">09.12</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Anggaran TW4: dua pos perlu persetujuan Anda</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">Biaya perangkat lunak sudah saya pindah ke belanja operasional sesuai kesepakatan. Pos perjalanan dinas masih lebih 8%, bisa dicek sebelum Jumat?</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">GR</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Galih Ramadhan</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-label=\"Ada lampiran\">attach_file</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">08.40</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Halaman pembayaran retribusi siap ditinjau</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">Virtual account dan kartu sudah berfungsi di staging. Bukti bayar terkirim lewat email dalam satu menit.</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\">\n    <span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SH</span>\n    <span class=\"inbox__body\">\n      <span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Sari Handayani</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">Kemarin</time></span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__subject\">Jadwal pengingat tagihan pajak</span>\n      <span class=\"inbox__preview\">Tiga hari sebelum dan pada tanggal jatuh tempo, sesuai pembahasan. Teksnya sudah saya taruh di dokumen.</span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Percakapan",
        "desc": "Daftar chat: nama dan jam di baris pertama, pesan terakhir dan count belum dibaca di baris kedua. Percakapan yang sedang dibuka berada di tint.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox inbox--avatars card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 380px;\" aria-label=\"Percakapan\">\n  <button class=\"inbox__row is-unread\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">TP</span><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Tim peluncuran</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">10.02</time></span><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Bima: catatan rilis sudah ada di dokumen</span><span class=\"count\">3<span class=\"sr-only\"> belum dibaca</span></span></span></span></button>\n  <button class=\"inbox__row\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\"><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray\" style=\"--size: 40px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DL</span><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Dewi Lestari</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">09.47</time></span><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Baik, sampai ketemu pukul 14.00</span></span></span></button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Dengan aksi geser",
        "desc": "Di ponsel setiap baris berada di dalam swipe: geser ke kiri untuk arsip dan hapus. Sediakan aksi yang sama di panel baca untuk yang tidak menggeser.",
        "html": "<div class=\"inbox card\" data-lds-inbox style=\"padding: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 420px;\" aria-label=\"Kotak masuk\">\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">archive</span>Arsipkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button></div>\n    <button class=\"inbox__row swipe__row is-unread\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Arif Santoso</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">07.55</time></span><span class=\"inbox__subject\">Undangan massal sudah aktif</span><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Tempel hingga 50 email, pilih peran, lalu kirim.</span></span></button></div>\n  <div class=\"swipe\" data-lds-swipe><div class=\"swipe__actions\"><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--accent\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"archive\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">archive</span>Arsipkan</button><button class=\"swipe__act swipe__act--danger\" type=\"button\" data-swipe=\"delete\" data-swipe-commit><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus</button></div>\n    <button class=\"inbox__row swipe__row\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"inbox__body\"><span class=\"inbox__line\"><span class=\"inbox__from\">Dewi Lestari</span><time class=\"inbox__time\">Sen</time></span><span class=\"inbox__subject\">Dark mode untuk grafik</span><span class=\"inbox__preview\">Warna seri sekarang lolos di kedua tema.</span></span></button></div>\n</div>"
